      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "What should be relatively important regardless of the size, is to allow scaling by default, and make the change for that option for the world creator something possible to change on the website. I have worlds i cannot reupload anymore, but I want people to be able to scale in there. \n\nThe removal of other means of scaling is detrimental if it is disallowed in many places, which to me seems extremely pointless and a really bad decision, that really removes a core feature that avatar creators always use nowadays. if the issue is people scaling too big and being disruptive, then it should simply disallow those extreme sizes unless the world creator allows unlimited scaling options.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
