      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Scaling absolutely needs to be enabled by default - and preferably without arbitrarily low limits. By disabling scaling by default, the default is functionally being changed - scaling has been de facto enabled in all worlds already. As such, by defaulting to disabled this breaks existing worlds, when in practice only a small number of worlds enforce scale currently. (I can think of two)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
