      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think hard capping avatar height and breaking everyone's scaling is probably the worst implementation of this idea one could come up with. I understand being uncomfortable with a sudden change per world, but you can't just take away the ability of others to feel comfortable. Plenty of folks have avatars well over 9ft, mine is twice that and I have friends who are even taller. You have to curate your own experience on the internet, it's just a part of life and trying to take away from other's experiences for your own comfort is selfish",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
