      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "My option based on the above, \n\nDefault for all worlds: Let the player chose [Scaling off, Scaling 2-9ft]\n\nFor worlds with Scaling Explicitly turned on, have no default scale limits. \n\nWorlds can then set custom limits and possibly scale the user's avatar on demand. Which could be used for neat effect in game or story worlds.",
