      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{6494fb57bec709090d2ae775|full_name}: Sorry! I meant for people to be able to keep their own avatar height of course. I would never want people to be capped on height, that would be awful. I would only be suggesting this as an additional option people could toggle on, and I hope that VRC people looking at this would realize that. I was looking for a middle ground so that even in worlds where scaling wasn't enabled people could still have access to some scaling, without coming up against the argument of \"what if this breaks the world?\"\n\nI would of course prefer scaling to be on all the time personally, and definitely on by default in worlds that haven't picked an option (I upvoted that one too).",
